# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# QS-VC On-Premises Configuration Template
# Copy to config/.env and configure for your intranet environment
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# General Deployment Mode
NODE_ENV=production
QSVC_DEPLOYMENT=onprem

DOMAIN=meet.internal
QSVC_PUBLIC_URL=https://meet.internal
WEB_URL=https://meet.internal
AUTH_PUBLIC_URL=https://meet.internal
CORS_ORIGINS=https://meet.internal

# Platform Administrator Emails (Comma-separated, REQUIRED in on-prem mode)
QSVC_ADMIN_EMAILS=

# Database (PostgreSQL)
POSTGRES_HOST=postgres
POSTGRES_PORT=5432
POSTGRES_DB=qsvc
POSTGRES_USER=qsvc
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=

# Redis (Session & pub/sub cache)
REDIS_HOST=redis
REDIS_PORT=6379
REDIS_PASSWORD=

# JWT Authentication
JWT_EXPIRY=1h

# Optional external payment checkout. Leave disabled for offline/air-gapped sites.
# Provider webhooks require a public HTTPS callback reachable from the provider.
PAYMENTS_ENABLED=false
PAYMENT_TERMS_CONFIRMED=false
PAYMENT_RETURN_URL=https://meet.internal
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
RAZORPAY_PLAN_STARTER=
RAZORPAY_PLAN_PRO=
PAYPAL_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox
PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=
PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET=
PAYPAL_WEBHOOK_ID=
PAYPAL_PLAN_STARTER=
PAYPAL_PLAN_PRO=
PAYPAL_PLAN_STARTER_TRIAL=
PAYPAL_PLAN_PRO_TRIAL=
PAYPAL_CURRENCY=USD
PAYPAL_STARTER_BASE_AMOUNT=
PAYPAL_PRO_BASE_AMOUNT=
CASHFREE_ENVIRONMENT=production
CASHFREE_API_VERSION=2026-01-01
CASHFREE_CLIENT_ID=
CASHFREE_CLIENT_SECRET=
CASHFREE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Media & SFU Configuration
SFU_PORT=4000
SFU_ANNOUNCED_IP=10.0.0.10
SFU_MIN_PORT=40000
SFU_MAX_PORT=40100
SFU_CONTROL_TOKEN=

# TURN / STUN (Coturn)
TURN_SECRET=
TURN_SERVERS=turn:10.0.0.10:3478

# MinIO (S3-compatible Object Storage for meeting recordings)
MINIO_ENDPOINT=minio
MINIO_PORT=9000
MINIO_ACCESS_KEY=
MINIO_SECRET_KEY=
MINIO_BUCKET=qsvc-recordings

# MCU & FreeSWITCH Configuration (for Polycom / Cisco SIP / H.323 room systems)
MCU_ENABLED=false
POLY_BRIDGE_ENABLED=false
BRIDGE_API_TOKEN=
FS_ESL_HOST=127.0.0.1
FS_ESL_PORT=8021

# Multilingual AI Services (Local / Intranet MT and ASR)
CAPTION_TRANSLATION_PROVIDER=
LIBRETRANSLATE_URL=
ASR_URL=
ENABLE_ONPREM_GOOGLE_TRANSLATION=false

# AI Meeting Minutes (Local Ollama or vLLM)
MINUTES_LLM_URL=
MINUTES_LLM_MODEL=
MINUTES_LLM_API_KEY=

SESSION_SIGNING_KEY_FILE=
INTERNAL_AUTH_SECRET=
TURN_ACCESS_SECRET=
MEETING_POLICY_SECRET=
INVITATION_SECRET=
ORIGIN_AUTH_SECRET=

AUTH_DB_USER=qs_auth_app
AUTH_DB_PASSWORD=

MEETING_DB_USER=qs_meeting_app
MEETING_DB_PASSWORD=
# Optional local AI: ASR_URL=http://asr:8000, LIBRETRANSLATE_URL=http://mt:5000
ASR_API_KEY=
LIBRETRANSLATE_API_KEY=
